  "meta": {
    "title": "Conveyor motor starter: terminals, terminal strip and wires", "project": "EX-54",
    "client": "Example Logistics Hall", "author": "uniwire examples", "lang": "en",
    "notes": [
      "Demonstrates: format 1.1 wiring (UEP-0001): the terminals of the devices (KM1#A1, F1#95, A1#0.9), a terminal strip -X1 and the wires between them, with marks, sections, colours, and the wires the installer makes on site",
      "The PLC output 0.9 drives the contactor coil through the overload contact 95-96; the auxiliary contact 13-14 reports 'running' to input 0.1",
      "Exports: 'uniwire wires' (wire list), 'uniwire markers' (ferrules), 'uniwire terminals' (terminal plan of -X1)"
    ]
  },
